    "text": "WWMT\nwebsite\nKalamazoo\nWATCH: Video shows July 1 fight inside Kalamazoo County Courthouse\nBy Autumn Pitchure,1 days ago\nKALAMAZOO, Mich. — New video released by the Kalamazoo County Administration shows a large fight that broke out inside an elevator of the county's courthouse on July 1. The fight started when two families got into a dispute following a court hearing, according to the Kalamazoo County Sheriff's Office (KCSO).\n1\nComments\nLoading editor...",
